{"batchcomplete":"","continue":{"gsroffset":10,"continue":"gsroffset||"},"query":{"pages":{"83134628":{"pageid":83134628,"ns":6,"title":"File:$7.95 All-You-Can-Eat - Chennai Banana Leaf (75050682).jpg","index":1,"imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"thumburl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0c/%247.95_All-You-Can-Eat_-_Chennai_Banana_Leaf_%2875050682%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","thumbwidth":960,"thumbheight":720,"thumbattribs":{"src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0c/%247.95_All-You-Can-Eat_-_Chennai_Banana_Leaf_%2875050682%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","decoding":"async","loading":"lazy","width":960,"height":720},"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0c/%247.95_All-You-Can-Eat_-_Chennai_Banana_Leaf_%2875050682%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:$7.95_All-You-Can-Eat_-_Chennai_Banana_Leaf_(75050682).jpg","descriptionshorturl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=83134628","extmetadata":{"DateTime":{"value":"2019-10-16 13:54:56","source":"mediawiki-metadata","hidden":""},"ObjectName":{"value":"$7.95 All-You-Can-Eat - Chennai Banana Leaf (75050682)","source":"mediawiki-metadata"},"CommonsMetadataExtension":{"value":1.2,"source":"extension","hidden":""},"Categories":{"value":"Flickr images reviewed by FlickreviewR 2|Files from rice tag of Alpha Flickr stream uploaded by Netha Hussain","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"Assessments":{"value":"","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"ImageDescription":{"value":"<p>Not bad value, but the curries seemed a bit watered down for the all-you-can-eat. They also use the curries in a la carte dishes they serve, so perhaps it is an indication of lowered standards.\n</p><p>The all-you-can-eat includes a small dish of chicken curry.\n</p><p>The curries included dahl (yellow split pea), rasam (tamarind based), braised cabbage with spices and a fish curry gravy I think. And it includes papadoms, basmati rice and spiced ghee rice with cardamom and cloves.\n</p>\n&lt;a href=\"<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://www.theage.com.au/news/Reviews/Chennai-Banana-Leaf/2005/05/16/1116095890855.html\">http://www.theage.com.au/news/Reviews/Chennai-Banana-Leaf/2005/05/16/1116095890855.html</a>\" rel=\"nofollow\"&gt;www.theage.com.au/news/Reviews/Chennai-Banana-Leaf/2005/0...&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/a&gt;","source":"commons-desc-page"},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value":"2005-12-19 12:44","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Credit":{"value":"<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.flickr.com/photos/avlxyz/75050682/\">$7.95 All-You-Can-Eat - Chennai Banana Leaf</a>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Artist":{"value":"<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.flickr.com/people/10559879@N00\">Alpha</a> from Melbourne, Australia","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"CC BY-SA 2.0","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"UsageTerms":{"value":"Creative Commons Attribution-Share Alike 2.0","source":"commons-desc-page"},"AttributionRequired":{"value":"true","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"LicenseUrl":{"value":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Copyrighted":{"value":"True","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"Restrictions":{"value":"","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"License":{"value":"cc-by-sa-2.0","source":"commons-templates","hidden":""}}}]},"195538981":{"pageid":195538981,"ns":6,"title":"File:American cookery (IA americancookery19unse 6).pdf","index":8,"imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"thumburl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/87/American_cookery_%28IA_americancookery19unse_6%29.pdf/page1-500px-American_cookery_%28IA_ameri